 lang=\"KO\"\u003e10월 \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e사이드 스토리 / 메인 스토리 업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 36.0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000ff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e2월에 업데이트될 메인 스토리는,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e지금까지 쌓아온 여러 이야기들이 한 차례 정리되고,\u003cbr\u003e앞으로 나아갈 것은 분명하게 나아가는 구간이 될 예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e이야기의 흐름상 빌드업에 해당하는 시점이지만,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e그 안에서도 충분히 인상적이게 느끼실 수 있는 장면들을 담고 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000ff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e또한 2026년에 전개될 스토리에서는\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e니케들의 서사가 한 차례 더 나아가며,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e일부 CEO들의 과거, 그리고 오스왈드의 또 다른 이야기 등\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e다양한 이야기들을 차분히 풀어갈 예정입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e특히 개인적으로는 2026년 스토리 중\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e4주년에 공개하게 될 메인 스토리와 이벤트 스토리에\u003cbr\u003e큰 기대감\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e을 가지고 준비하고 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e그동안 한 겹씩 쌓아 올려온 서사와 감정선들이,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e다시 한번 의미를 드러내는 시기가 될 것이라 생각합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e지휘관 여러분께서\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e니케의 세계와 캐릭터에 자연스럽게 몰입하실 수 있도록,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e최선을 다해 준비하도록 하겠습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003e전투 콘텐츠 업데이트 방향\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; line-height: 115%;\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e승리의 여신: 니케\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e에서 내러티브만큼 중요한 것이 있다면\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e다양한 니케들과 함께할 수 있는 전투 콘텐츠일 것입니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e2026년에는 전투 콘텐츠에 있어\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e무엇보다도 \u003cstrong\u003e안정적인 플레이 경험 제공\u003c/strong\u003e을 최우선으로 생각하고 있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e안정적인 플레이 경험을 제공함과 동시에 콘텐츠 측면에서도\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e몇 가지 업데이트 예정 사항이 있어 안내드리고자 합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000ff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e먼저, 2026년에는 \u003cstrong\u003e2월과 7월, 총 두 번의\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e솔로 레이드 뮤지엄 보스 업데이트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e가 진행될 예정인데요.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e 우선 2월의 보스 업데이트 정보를 안내드립니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; margin: 12.0pt 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000ff; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"\u003e●\u003cspan style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal;\"\u003e \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e4시즌 :\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan lang=\"KO\"\u003e알트아이젠 [P.S.I.D.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/